pan>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"6\"\n                     >\n              <span>6</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"7\"\n                     >\n              <span>7</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"8\"\n                     >\n              <span>8</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"9\"\n                     >\n              <span>9</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"10\"\n                     >\n              <span>10</span>\n            </label>\n          \n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <div class=\"enc-cd-pick__row\">\n        <p class=\"enc-cd-pick__status\" data-role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n        <button type=\"submit\"\n                class=\"enc-cd-pick__submit\"\n                data-role=\"submit\"\n                disabled>\n          Confirm pick\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  \n</section>\n",
 "letter_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-letter enc-cd-letter--medium\"\n         aria-label=\"LLaMa's read on this race\">\n  <header class=\"enc-cd-letter__head\">\n    <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🦙</span>\n    <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__title-block\">\n      <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__eyebrow\">LLaMa&rsquo;s read</p>\n      <h2 class=\"enc-cd-letter__title\">Predicted 1&mdash;2&mdash;3&mdash;4</h2>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <ol class=\"enc-cd-letter__slots\">\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-1\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥇\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            1st\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">9/2</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Devon Angel</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">Top of the deterministic model at 6.20, led by the race&#x27;s largest market-move signal (+0.8); SR 59 heads the realistic contenders at the weights, and De Sousa&#x27;s booking seals it.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-2\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥈\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            2nd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">2/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Hemustbeanangel</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 68 is the race&#x27;s best figure and Teal&#x27;s 38% yard form is exceptional, but a +4lb weight rise versus last run blunts the advantage and keeps this one a place behind.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-3\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥉\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            3rd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">4/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Past Passion</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 72 is the headline number in the race, but Portman&#x27;s yard at 6% over the fortnight is a serious flag; still talented enough to hit the frame at a moderate pace.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-4\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          4\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            4th\n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">11/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">So Tempting</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">A steamer at 11/1 with a +0.8 market-move driver mirrors Devon Angel&#x27;s profile at longer odds; hold-up style suits a moderate tempo, making this the each-way outsider with a genuine tell.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ol>\n\n  \n    <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__verdict\">Win, Devon Angel, 1 unit at 9/2. This is a medium-confidence call — the case is clear but Hemustbeanangel&#x27;s SR and yard form keep the door open. Mr Fox has gone with Hemustbeanangel in the notebook, and I understand the argument completely: SR 68 is the best figure in the field and Roger Teal at 38% over the fortnight is the kind of stable form that wins races. But Hemustbeanangel carries +4lb more than last run, the 2/1 price compresses the value considerably, and the weight rise matters in a five-and-a-half furlong sprint on good-to-firm. Devon Angel&#x27;s market trajectory — 50/1 on debut, now steaming again at 9/2 — is the loudest signal on this card. I&#x27;ll take the bigger price on the horse the market keeps backing.</p>\n  \n\n  \n    <a class=\"enc-cd-letter__more\" href=\"https://www.saturday-racing.com/letters/bath-2026-09-29/1635/\">\n      Read the full letter &rarr;\n    </a>\n  \n</section>\n",
